<title>MALI: SOCCER-MALI BEAT ALGERIA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MALI BEAT ALGERIA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mali beat Algeria 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in an African Nations Cup group two qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Bassala Toure 63</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
